@startuml sequence-send-notification
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
hide footbox
title Sequence — Send notification (UC8a, included in UC8)

box "REST API (FastAPI)" #FFF3E0
  participant ":ReservationsRouter" as ResRouter
end box
box "Services — implementations of NotificationService" #E8F5E9
  participant ":EmailNotificationService" as Email
  participant ":LoggingNotificationService" as Logging
end box
participant "smtp : SMTP\n(smtplib)" as SMTP
actor Customer

note over ResRouter
  The reservation r has just been set
  to CONFIRMED (UC8). notification_service
  was chosen once at startup by
  _build_notification_service():
  SMTP_HOST set → Email…, otherwise Logging…
end note

alt SMTP_HOST is set → notification_service is an EmailNotificationService
  ResRouter -> Email : send_confirmation(r, r.user)
  Email -> Email : build EmailMessage\n(subject "Rezervace #id potvrzena",\nreservation no., dates, total price)
  create SMTP
  Email -> SMTP : <<create>> SMTP(host, port, timeout = 10)
  Email -> SMTP : starttls()
  opt SMTP_USER and SMTP_PASSWORD set
    Email -> SMTP : login(username, password)
  end
  Email -> SMTP : send_message(message)
  alt e-mail sent
    SMTP --> Email : accepted
    SMTP -> Customer : confirmation e-mail
    Email -> Email : logger.info("Confirmation e-mail sent ...")
    Email --> ResRouter : true
  else sending failed (exception)
    SMTP --> Email : Exception / no connection
    Email -> Email : logger.exception("Failed to e-mail ...")\n(the reservation stays CONFIRMED)
    Email --> ResRouter : false
  end
else no SMTP_HOST → notification_service is a LoggingNotificationService
  ResRouter -> Logging : send_confirmation(r, r.user)
  Logging -> Logging : logger.info("Notification: reservation ...\nconfirmed for <name> <email>")\n(no e-mail is sent)
  Logging --> ResRouter : true
end

note over Customer
  Sees the reservation as CONFIRMED
  in "Moje rezervace" (UC6)
  (+ the e-mail, if one was sent)
end note
@enduml
